category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libssl-devel python3-pytest zlib-devel
sdesc: "C library for creating Excel XLSX files (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libxlsxwriter is a C library that can be used to write text, numbers, formulas
and hyperlinks to multiple worksheets in an Excel 2007+ XLSX file."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/jmcnamara/libxlsxwriter
license: BSD-2-Clause AND BSD-3-Clause AND Zlib
